! WesthaneTemplates
Custom view templates for the Impossible Lands wiki.

* Character (Text / Statistics tabs, portrait): tag `Character`
* Place (Text / Map tabs, parent/child sidebar, hooks): tag `Place`
* System (tag-index lists, Minor / Inactive folds): tag `System`
* Standard: every other content tiddler (info box, frontmatter, body, backmatter)
* Inactive: tiddlers tagged `Inactive`, ahead of all the others

Shared parts:

* Info box ([[$:/westhane/Template/Info]]): portrait for types listed in [[$:/westhane/config/PortraitTags]]
* Frontmatter ([[$:/westhane/Part/Frontmatter]]): `summarytext` field and "Part of [[Parent]]"
* Backmatter ([[$:/westhane/Part/Backmatter]]): children list with abbreviation pills, then the timeline
* Timeline ([[$:/westhane/Template/Timeline]], `<<timeline>>` procedure)

Each template has a core cascade (`…/Cascade`) and a TiddlyFlex cascade (`$:/westhane/TiddlyFlex/ViewTemplateBodyFilter/…`).

!! External dependencies
The Map tab needs flibbles/graph and the `$:/westhane/TiddlyGraph/*` and `$:/westhane/vis-network/*` tiddlers, which are not in this plugin.

